{"t":"read","text":"You want a samosa, so we fit one in alongside some protein and fibre to keep your afternoon steady."}
{"t":"plate","name":"Samosa with chana chaat and chai","min":0,"items":[{"q":1,"u":"piece","f":"samosa"},{"q":1,"u":"katori","f":"boiled chana chaat with lemon"},{"q":2,"u":"tablespoon","f":"mint green chutney"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"cutting chai with less sugar"}],"why":"Pairing one samosa with chana and green chutney balances the fried snack with fibre and protein.","skip":"extra sweet tamarind chutney and a second samosa","later":"have a lighter dinner with dal, sabzi, and phulka"}
