{"t":"plate","name":"Boiled eggs with fruit and buttermilk","min":10,"items":[{"q":2,"u":"","f":"boiled eggs with black pepper"},{"q":1,"u":"piece","f":"small banana"},{"q":1,"u":"glass","f":"spiced buttermilk with curry leaves"}],"why":"Eggs deliver quick protein for tired muscles while the banana and buttermilk restore spent energy and fluids.", "later":"Have a regular lunch later with dal, vegetables, and rice."}
